Subject: About your account

--- text/plain ---
Hello,

First line.
Second line.

Write to <support@example.com>.

SourceOrigin support wrote this message about your Origin Account. It is also in your Origin Account notifications whenever you can sign in.

https://auth.sourceorigin.dev/settings/notifications

SourceOrigin

